# .terraform.lock.hcl is committed (both stacks). It was written with
# `terraform providers lock -platform=linux_amd64 -platform=darwin_arm64
# -platform=darwin_amd64`, so it holds registry checksums for CI and the
# laptop alike; a -plugin-dir install only verifies against it.
